---
/**
 * Loader for Google's Preferred Sources button.
 *
 * Kept separate from PreferredSource.astro so the script is requested exactly
 * once per page from <head>, no matter how many buttons a page renders. Astro
 * would otherwise emit a duplicate <script> per component instance.
 *
 * `async` because nothing above the fold depends on it — the button is in the
 * footer, and a blocking third-party request there would cost real LCP on a
 * site whose Core Web Vitals we actually watch (see Analytics.astro).
 */
---
<script async src="https://news.google.com/swg/js/v1/publisher.js"></script>
